{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G2-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區號誌路口的速限提示、號誌辨識與行人通行問題","intro":"主要道路約 14 m、次要道路約 10 m，均為雙向各一混合車道，速限 30 km/h。周邊以工廠及未開發土地為主，兩側未設人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"speed","title":"速限資訊不足","text":"兩條道路雖有 30 km/h 速限，但現況缺少完整的速限標誌與標字提示。"},{"id":"signal","title":"號誌辨識易受環境影響","text":"路側樹叢可能影響號誌辨識；東西向號誌另須注意晨昏眩光問題。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"缺少人行設施與穿越考量","text":"鄰近工廠仍可能有行人活動，但路側缺乏人行設施，號誌配置亦須考慮行人穿越需求。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[53,54],"strategy":{"title":"車道與路側空間配置、路口預告及號誌設置","intro":"以分向限制線界定雙向車道，並配合鄉區道路環境，檢討路口預告、號誌辨識與行人通行方式。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-02-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"lanes","title":"界定車道及預留路側空間","text":"以分向限制線區分雙向車道，另行劃出路側空間，供未來設置人行道或停車使用。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"notice","title":"補充路口預告與路名標誌","text":"視需要增設岔路標誌，提前提示前方路口；路名標誌則依有無分向島選擇設置位置。"},{"id":"signal","title":"檢核號誌可視性與眩光","text":"檢核各方向近、遠端號誌的可視範圍，並考量東西向日照眩光，必要時增設不同角度的號誌燈面。","moduleId":"M2-03"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"兼顧不設行人專用號誌的通行需求","text":"若因行人稀少而未設行人專用號誌，仍須保留行人通行所需的燈面及圓形綠燈，不能僅設轉向箭頭燈。","moduleId":"M3-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-2-02-signalized-rural-orthogonal-t.typ","sha256":"294d98073d908c35673411f655073198f1c4a43a1c101ea65c3579cd0cb14ad6","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g2-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況圖_01.png","width":3350,"height":1883,"label":"G2-02 現況圖","scenario":"G2-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":53,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image47.png","sha256":"31abc7fdcd69d6d80ddd20dd6ecc2666d3cd3ee81e09e93c48dc37ab91529fa0"},"results:g2-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況照片_01.png","width":2563,"height":1048,"label":"G2-02 現況照片","scenario":"G2-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":54,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image48.png","sha256":"43057690c7e7613e5d99024644e1767b364f6d70bdde1b3253a3c4c8e2810cd1"},"results:g2-02-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況照片_02.png","width":2580,"height":1075,"label":"G2-02 現況照片 2","scenario":"G2-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":54,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image49.png","sha256":"572874f026d14222d5abafb07f57e2c8dce81fa5ebf91d957c2d7dd7f1d0a211"},"results:g2-02-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況照片_03.png","width":2598,"height":1054,"label":"G2-02 現況照片 3","scenario":"G2-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":54,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image50.png","sha256":"a02209f77619a09d675e3c80168c82d5ec5937dc9e9db9c4bc6a893d15848c48"},"results:g2-02-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G2-02/G2-02_號誌化鄉區正交三叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":1189,"height":565,"label":"G2-02 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G2-02","role":"strategy","sha256":"d56c54644effbe08da79cfaafb2b6ac6967c055691b5b6c2f413e454678b9d83"}}}
